 "intro_zh": "连州地下河位于粤西北连州市内，是一处巧夺天工的亚热带喀斯特地貌的典型巨型天然石灰岩溶洞。景区以其神秘瑰丽的钟乳石及洞穴暗河而驰名中外，又因为溶洞内四季气温保持在18℃左右，空气清新，冬暖夏凉，是旅游避暑的好去处。",
 "intro_en": "Lianzhou Underground River is located in Lianzhou City in northwest Guangdong. It is a typical giant natural limestone cave with an ingenious subtropical karst landform. The scenic spot is famous both at home and abroad for its mysterious and magnificent stalactites and underground rivers in the cave. And because the temperature in the cave remains at around 18°C ​​in all seasons, the air is fresh, warm in winter and cool in summer, making it a good place to escape the summer heat.",
